01:00:50.737 --> 01:00:54.496
And so trying to do the
stuff kind of on the fly,

01:00:54.496 --> 01:00:58.603
in June, July, August, September of 2020,

01:01:04.456 --> 01:01:06.250
as I pointed out, like I came back

