01:01:45.000 --> 01:01:47.483
I mean, obviously we were gonna do it,

01:01:47.483 --> 01:01:51.443
it was sort of baked into the cake

01:01:51.443 --> 01:01:52.293
that we were gonna do this,

01:01:54.040 --> 01:01:57.660
but it also should have been,

01:01:57.660 --> 01:02:02.660
I think, made a little
