01:02:07.918 --> 01:02:10.990
about what the relative
peers to compare to was,

01:02:10.990 --> 01:02:12.630
we didn't know enough about what was,

01:02:12.630 --> 01:02:15.803
it was just a massive data coming in,

01:02:15.803 --> 01:02:17.393
and we were making inferences too fast.

01:02:18.505 --> 01:02:22.890
- Eric I take your point that the timing

01:02:22.890 --> 01:02:24.870
of your returning to Florida

01:02:24.870 --> 01:02:27.120
and the rising hospitalization,

01:02:27.120 --> 01:02:30.250
I mean, I think one of
