01:04:31.550 --> 01:04:33.350
in my belief in this early on,

01:04:33.350 --> 01:04:38.020
that we should have been listening

01:04:38.020 --> 01:04:42.961
to the sort of conventional
wisdom about epidemics

01:04:42.961 --> 01:04:44.247
