01:05:13.170 --> 01:05:14.483
but it's gonna take years.

01:05:15.380 --> 01:05:19.040
And it seemed me foolish to be

01:05:19.960 --> 01:05:23.280
every month revising what guidelines were

01:05:23.280 --> 01:05:26.053
in response to inferences
that were being made

01:05:26.053 --> 01:05:28.601
