01:05:28.601 --> 01:05:33.601
even the normal procedures of peer review,

01:05:34.024 --> 01:05:36.770
we all know that ordinary peer review,

01:05:36.770 --> 01:05:41.610
it's not what secures the
reliability of science,

01:05:41.610 --> 01:05:44.300
much more in-depth
criticism has to take place.

01:05:44.300 --> 01:05:48.130
And just to referees,
before we get good science,

01:05:48.130 --> 01:05:51.480
